oremost global power."},"wikipedia":{"ru":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%91%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BF%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%8F","en":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/British_Empire"},"wikidata":"Q8680"}